<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="<%= I18n.locale %>">
  <head>
    <%= render "layouts/head" %>
  </head>

  <body>
    <%# `max-w-[40rem]` is the column `layouts/application` carries; change either and change both.
        One application has one column width, so a reader who signs in does not watch the page
        change shape. Tailwind 4 has no named `max-w-*` at 40rem, which is why it is an arbitrary
        value here as it is there. %>
    <div class="w-full max-w-[40rem] mx-auto min-h-dvh flex flex-col">
      <%# A `p` rather than a heading: every screen inside carries its own `h1`, and a masthead
          that competed with it would leave the page with two. %>
      <header class="px-4 py-3">
        <p class="text-hero"><%= Current.brand.name %></p>
        <%# Choir vocabulary on a brand that also serves bands. #223 gives the branded domains
            their own copy; until then every domain gets this line, which is what #245 asked for. %>
        <p class="text-meta">Who's coming to rehearsal.</p>
      </header>

      <div class="px-4 pt-3"><%= render "layouts/flash" %></div>

      <main class="px-4 py-3 grow">
        <%= yield %>
      </main>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
